    "body": "I'm experiencing this as well, but only on bash version 4. I'm a bit confused about all the fish discussion for a bug that has \"bash\" in the title, so I'm going to ignore that part and plod on ahead about bash :) \r\n\r\nAffected:\r\n```\r\nGNU bash, version 4.4.20(1)-release (x86_64-pc-linux-gnu)\r\n```\r\n\r\nUnaffected:\r\n```\r\nGNU bash, version 5.1.4(1)-release (aarch64-apple-darwin20.2.0)\r\nGNU bash, version 5.0.16(1)-release (x86_64-pc-linux-gnu)\r\n```\r\n\r\nSo I'm inclined to call it a bash-4 issue, but not sure why. On all three bashes above, I get \r\n\r\n```\r\n$ echo $SHLVL ; bash -c 'echo $SHLVL'\r\n1\r\n2\r\n```",
